WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 4.8 · People, Culture & Volunteers
Volunteers and community contributors

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Many initiatives start with volunteers: make it a two-way relationship from the first invitation.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Design each role before you invite anyone.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Check people in proportion to the risk.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Repay expenses; never let volunteers fill paid roles.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You design one first-year volunteer role and its support.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
